@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam PackageBackgroundColor white
skinparam PackageBorderColor black
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam minClassWidth 220
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 80
hide circle
hide empty members
package "前台联系与成功预约关联" as C {
' @reference followup_requirement
class "诊后要求" as requirement_c <<entity>>
' @reference appointment
class "预约" as appointment_c <<entity>>
class "联系经历" as contact_history <<entity>> {
 实际方式、时间、前台
 沟通事实、结果、下次联系日
 --
 +记录实际联系结果()
 +核对成功预约归属()
 +关联既有成功预约()
 +记录继续联系(日期)
}
requirement_c "1" -- "0..*" contact_history
appointment_c "0..1" -- "0..*" contact_history
requirement_c -[hidden]right- appointment_c
note bottom of contact_history
实际联系、预约、到诊和评估分别记录。
预约失败仍保存联系；不自动建预约。
需评估交牙医；免评估完成仍核对真实目的达成。
end note
}
@enduml
